From: htrecomp
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: REXGLUE_ROOT must be visible to add_subdirectory consumers

A plain set() is directory-scoped, so REXGLUE_ROOT does not exist in a parent
project that pulls the SDK in with add_subdirectory and then calls
rexglue_configure_target() from its own scope.

_rexglue_stage_macos_vulkan_runtime() builds the MoltenVK ICD path as
"${REXGLUE_ROOT}/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json". With the variable empty that becomes
the absolute path "/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json", and the macOS build fails at the
final link step, after every object has compiled:

  Error copying file (if different) from "/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json" to
  ".../vulkan/share/vulkan/icd.d/MoltenVK_icd.json": No such file or directory

The SDK's own CI builds the SDK standalone, where the plain set() is in scope,
so this only affects add_subdirectory consumers on macOS.

CACHE INTERNAL makes it visible everywhere without changing its value.
---
diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 9b3cdf5..57f3ccf 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -52,8 +52,20 @@ if (REXGLUE_ENABLE_FIDELITYFX AND
         "REXGLUE_ENABLE_FIDELITYFX requires at least one graphics backend")
 endif()
 
-# Root of the SDK source tree
-set(REXGLUE_ROOT "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}")
+# Root of the SDK source tree.
+#
+# CACHE INTERNAL, not a plain set(): a plain set() is directory-scoped, so it is
+# invisible to a parent project that pulls the SDK in with add_subdirectory and
+# then calls rexglue_configure_target() from its own scope. That is not
+# hypothetical - _rexglue_stage_macos_vulkan_runtime() builds the MoltenVK ICD
+# path as "${REXGLUE_ROOT}/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json", which silently becomes the
+# absolute path "/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json" and fails the macOS link step with:
+#
+#   Error copying file (if different) from "/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json" ...
+#
+# The SDK's own CI builds standalone, where the plain set() is in scope, so this
+# only shows up for add_subdirectory consumers on macOS.
+set(REXGLUE_ROOT "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}" CACHE INTERNAL "rexglue SDK source root")
 
 # SDK install support
 include(GNUInstallDirs)
